    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>You come from a line of heroes. It could be that your parents and their parents and their parents have all been heroes. Maybe you're adopted into a hero family. Regardless of how you came to be a part of this dynasty, heroism is part of your life.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Qualities</div><p>Assign a d10 and a d10 to two of these qualities:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.qualities.Item.JbpF0zq2JHhwxVHD]{Close Combat}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.qualities.Item.OKWz93VvHmWerVbv]{Fitness}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.qualities.Item.JzAMmM18LkxtTJqA]{History}</p><p>• Select from Social qualities category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Principle</div><p>Choose an Ideals principle.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Power Source</div><p>Roll d8, d8, d6 for power source selection.</p></section>"
